"`cgem_gid_to_*` 与 `get_cgem_gid` 都由编译好的 NumPy ufunc 实现。标量、NumPy 数组与 "
"Awkward Array 三种输入的调用方式完全一致："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/cgem.md 126bce9720984b42a1e859840072ca1e
#: 43df1b18f46a422795cc7bf648e41ab3 7e9df0d0e3374351a47385a06685c2b5
