#: ../../docs/user-manual/cgem.md:90 ae3c5c679ae44bb8835185c2ae31b8a5
msgid "Strip geometry"
msgstr "strip 几何"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/cgem.md:92 d5d86b504b7e4f7c93152c8985aca352
msgid ""
"All `cgem_gid_to_width`, `cgem_gid_to_radius`, `cgem_gid_to_phi0`, "
"`cgem_gid_to_dphi`, `cgem_gid_to_z0` and `cgem_gid_to_dz` are also backed"
" by compiled NumPy ufuncs. The calling convention is identical for "
"scalar, NumPy array, and Awkward Array inputs:"
msgstr ""
"`cgem_gid_to_width`、`cgem_gid_to_radius`、`cgem_gid_to_phi0`、`cgem_gid_to_dphi`、`cgem_gid_to_z0`"
" 与 `cgem_gid_to_dz` 同样由编译好的 NumPy ufunc 实现。标量、NumPy 数组与 Awkward Array "
"三种输入的调用方式完全一致："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/cgem.md:153 7ca9ff902d1747a298cd8520427bc650
msgid ""
"The centre line of a strip is described in the global cylindrical "
"coordinate system. `radius` is the distance (cm) of the strip from the "
"beam axis, and `width` is the width (cm) of the strip, which is measured "
"along the arc direction for an x-strip and perpendicular to the strip for"
" a v-strip."
msgstr ""
"strip 的中心线在全局柱坐标系中描述。`radius` 是 strip 到束流轴的距离（cm）；`width` 是 strip "
"的宽度（cm），对 x-strip 沿弧方向测量，对 v-strip 垂直于 strip 测量。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/cgem.md:158 5724b56fb00142b4853afd88c89550e7
msgid ""
"The other four values parametrise the centre line from its start point "
"($t = 0$), which is the end with the most negative z, to its other end "
"($t = 1$):"
msgstr "另外四个值从中心线的起点（$t = 0$，即 z 最负的一端）到另一端（$t = 1$）参数化这条中心线："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/cgem.md:161 318ff919699f4e9097f105338371d2f6
msgid ""
"\\phi(t) = \\phi_0 + t \\cdot \\Delta\\phi, \\qquad z(t) = z_0 + t \\cdot"
" \\Delta z, \\qquad 0 \\le t \\le 1"
msgstr ""
"\\phi(t) = \\phi_0 + t \\cdot \\Delta\\phi, \\qquad z(t) = z_0 + t \\cdot"
" \\Delta z, \\qquad 0 \\le t \\le 1"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/cgem.md:163 0b6614ef95fd4fce98f722a8351b7bca
msgid "`phi0`, `z0`: azimuth (rad) and z (cm) of the start point;"
msgstr "`phi0`、`z0`：起点的方位角（rad）与 z（cm）；"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/cgem.md:164 1997b20370964472ac7c57cbcb4878e4
msgid ""
"`dphi`, `dz`: changes of the azimuth (rad) and of the z (cm) along the "
"strip, from the start point to the other end; their signs give the "
"direction of the strip (`dz` is always positive, because the start point "
"is the negative z end)."
msgstr ""
"`dphi`、`dz`：从起点到另一端，方位角（rad）与 z（cm）的变化量；其符号给出 strip 的走向（`dz` 恒为正，因为起点是 z "
"的负端）。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/cgem.md:168 036bd5d5ffd642fa8e941a28e81e495f
msgid ""
"`dphi` is 0 for x-strips, which run along the beam axis, and non-zero for"
" v-strips, which are tilted by the stereo angle."
msgstr "x-strip 沿束流轴延伸，`dphi` 为 0；v-strip 因 stereo 角而倾斜，`dphi` 非 0。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/cgem.md:172 6df24f4c016643709031c483d474b94f
msgid ""
"`radius` and `width` only depend on the strip type and the layer, so they"
" take a few distinct values, whereas `phi0`, `dphi`, `z0` and `dz` vary "
"from strip to strip."
msgstr ""
"`radius` 与 `width` 只取决于 strip 类型和层号，因此只有少数几个取值；而 `phi0`、`dphi`、`z0`、`dz` "
"逐条 strip 各不相同。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/cgem.md:178 ad4482e2dbce4a5485184cd2a0b62624
msgid ""
"The position along a strip can be converted between the azimuth and the z"
" coordinate with `cgem_gid_phi_to_z` and `cgem_gid_z_to_phi`. They take "
"two arguments (`gid` and `phi` or `z`), both supporting scalar/array "
"inputs independently:"
msgstr ""
"strip 上的位置可以在方位角与 z 坐标之间互换，使用 `cgem_gid_phi_to_z` 与 "
"`cgem_gid_z_to_phi`。它们接受两个参数（`gid` 与 `phi` 或 `z`），两者都独立支持标量/数组输入："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/cgem.md:234 e80aa2bf339a41e2a91b2baf09fc9bd2
msgid ""
"Both functions are backed by compiled NumPy ufuncs and use linear "
"interpolation between the two ends of the strip, without any range check,"
" so a `phi` or `z` outside the strip is extrapolated."
msgstr ""
"这两个函数都由编译好的 NumPy ufunc 实现，在 strip 两端之间做线性插值，且不做范围检查，因此超出 strip 范围的 `phi`"
" 或 `z` 会被外推。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/cgem.md:238 23aaca2854304ffdb1e56d4e38c63c2e
msgid ""
"They differ in how they treat the azimuth: `cgem_gid_phi_to_z` takes the "
"offset of `phi` from `phi0` as the representative which is within half a "
"turn of the middle of the strip. A `phi` given in any period therefore "
"gives the same z, and every strip, including one spanning more than half "
"a turn, is covered exactly once. `cgem_gid_z_to_phi` does not reduce "
"anything: it returns a phi which follows `phi0 + (z - z0) / dz * dphi` "
"and is not wrapped into $[-\\pi, \\pi]$."
msgstr ""
"二者的区别在于对角度的处理：`cgem_gid_phi_to_z` 取 `phi` 相对 `phi0` 的偏移中「与 strip "
"中点相差不超过半圈」的那个代表值。因此任意周期给出的 `phi` 都得到相同的 z，且每条 "
"strip（包括跨过半圈以上的）都被恰好覆盖一次。`cgem_gid_z_to_phi` 则不做任何归化：它返回按 `phi0 + (z - "
"z0) / dz * dphi` 计算出的 phi，不折叠到 $[-\\pi, \\pi]$。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/cgem.md:246 bf7dc246be2b47f181eefc7031716210
msgid ""
"An x-strip runs along the z axis, so `cgem_gid_z_to_phi` always returns "
"its `phi0`, whereas `cgem_gid_phi_to_z` returns NaN, since its phi does "
"not give any z."
msgstr ""
"x-strip 沿 z 轴延伸，因此 `cgem_gid_z_to_phi` 总是返回其 `phi0`；而 `cgem_gid_phi_to_z`"
" 返回 NaN，因为它的 phi 无法给出任何 z。"

#: ../../docs/user-manual/cgem.md:252 34f976a39a2f4f15a93fbbf4f0a43f10
msgid "Retrieve the full strip geometry table:"
msgstr "获取完整的 strip 几何表："

#: ../../docs/user-manual/cgem.md:265 98131bc3d22a4bcaaf3d3f4739c3fe14
msgid ""
"The table holds `gid`, `layer`, `sheet`, `strip_type`, `strip`, `r`, "
"`width`, `phi0`, `dphi`, `z0` and `dz`. Here `r` and `width` are the same"
" values as the ones returned by `cgem_gid_to_radius` and "
"`cgem_gid_to_width`."
msgstr ""
"表中包含 "
"`gid`、`layer`、`sheet`、`strip_type`、`strip`、`r`、`width`、`phi0`、`dphi`、`z0`"
" 与 `dz`。其中 `r` 与 `width` 就是 `cgem_gid_to_radius` 与 `cgem_gid_to_width` "
"返回的值。"

